  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN 2023 Geothermal Project Management Short Cohort Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This course will provide 30 participants from Indonesia and Philippines with the required base knowledge to manage geothermal projects in their home country. Renewable energy production, including geothermal, is an increasing priority for these partners.&#xA0;It is an intensive course for engineers and managers (from both state-owned enterprises and energy development companies)&#xA0;to upskill for future geothermal projects.</narrative>
  </description>
